<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NZ's Peters says NZ dollar could fall further.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NZ's Peters says NZ dollar could fall further.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Deputy Prime Minister and Treasurer Winston Peters said on Wednesday that the New Zealand dollar might fall further still.</p>
<p>&quot;It will probably go a bit further still on forecasts,&quot; Peters told a business lunch in Sydney, referring to the New Zealand dollar, which has fallen five percent since February.</p>
</text>
